<title>POLAND: Polis c.bank sells PLN 201 mln of its 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Polis c.bank sells PLN 201 mln of its 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland drained 201 million zlotys from the market through a reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction after banks bid to place the same amount with the central bank, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The average yield was flat at 22.20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
